{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_001tom_02_1_2_001_02",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:e44e442b54080695ace8992c69406b713ef6b62016dd20eab384280d5b3687e0",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_02_1_2_001_02:1_2_001_02_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3fe8b7b63fbb8b5b2b765134640cce0fc3f728f0b2552ff310d85d8eb936ac35",
      "text": "世界上独一无二的生日咖喱",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_02_1_2_001_02:1_2_001_02_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:12913a74fc568fa6eabd579ff8cb95049a985c1692cd65c47ac42eb5d61aff11",
      "text": "马上就到冬马的生日了。\n翔太和北斗计划在派对上为冬马\n亲手制作咖喱。而冬马虽然\n没有察觉到两人的心思，\n却对咖喱的香气敏锐地捕捉到了……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_02_1_2_001_02:1_2_001_02_a:cmd-000014:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b09bcd6e18d66980a219b2c252065efab172f9d4ca056860b35d17112afe537",
      "text": "第2话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_02_1_2_001_02:1_2_001_02_a:cmd-000014:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3fe8b7b63fbb8b5b2b765134640cce0fc3f728f0b2552ff310d85d8eb936ac35",
      "text": "世界上独一无二的生日咖喱",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_02_1_2_001_02:1_2_001_02_a:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:546ac1812cbd825cd2552f04e7f2262805d094fb2c1e2a4353c0560defe155c0",
      "text": "马上就是冬马君的生日了呢！\n怎么办好呢？吃点什么～？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_02_1_2_001_02:1_2_001_02_a:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:db9184121206980c91c3a98a9026f9612dda5b6e814b171e94fe954c749f543b",
      "text": "从商量吃什么入手，真有翔太的风格啊。\n在那之前我有件事想商量一下，可以吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_02_1_2_001_02:1_2_001_02_a:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:97e0fabdba9207abc00e070c5ed5f59040c01277c05b52ce7a4087857f147948",
      "text": "商量？是可以啦，什么事呀？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_02_1_2_001_02:1_2_001_02_a:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6e923228a9ae0d68e435875dfebca269922799fd4b8284af74dc39703db53e3d",
      "text": "我在想，这次生日\n要不要由我们来做料理呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_02_1_2_001_02:1_2_001_02_a:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4762408de1640dda5582e05e877fed28933b9519bb62d78bd4c95bb2d1530753",
      "text": "哎，北斗君会做饭吗？虽然见过\n你给冬马君打下手的样子就是了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_02_1_2_001_02:1_2_001_02_a:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ec93cc14bdcf5c0fe15a269cdf2b82616d3a23f18a431a65e56100632c4be35e",
      "text": "嗯。像冬马那样太讲究的料理\n虽然很难做，但最基本的还是能做的哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_02_1_2_001_02:1_2_001_02_a:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7214963692125961dba3288ffeeef32aa6b59d3170c1b51377d6c052b9937025",
      "text": "这样啊。原来是这样。\n我这次也可以只负责试吃吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_02_1_2_001_02:1_2_001_02_a:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1419186af5dc244fa13c7539c277e241b21edaddd73d3802f26a60051cfd5c86",
      "text": "拜托你啦。\n毕竟翔太的评价切中要害，很有参考价值呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_02_1_2_001_02:1_2_001_02_a:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c640cd49eaad1ff266faa60b6e55883621e8982552465e58a3ed0f4bc4978463",
      "text": "哎呀，开玩笑的啦。\n家政课学过的那点东西我还是会帮忙的啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_02_1_2_001_02:1_2_001_02_a:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a28544ccd3ae77b836d721c5c2c0cb0246f0523dc503c8028dd40750abe068de",
      "text": "呵呵，那真是太感谢了。\n那么，说到我们两个人能做的料理……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_02_1_2_001_02:1_2_001_02_a:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a7b996a1be3b13e8974d7e459d359f0fd417e0f567791e8ca1511c6c93afe39a",
      "text": "唔……初学者也能做得像模像样的料理……\n……咖喱，之类的？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_02_1_2_001_02:1_2_001_02_a:cmd-000106:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ef4c12e52b4d824c567b394513b41cc92c353d13a218f8d31d87ee30af45dc69",
      "text": "呵呵，给冬马做咖喱可能有点挑战性呢。\n不过确实做这种难度的刚刚好呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_02_1_2_001_02:1_2_001_02_a:cmd-000113:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:145b8f8bd345743c672f719af0bf9ff838dde415c2b88c61b9c39105a2a292cb",
      "text": "冬马君的话肯定会开心的啦！\n我去问问能不能借用事务所的厨房！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_02_1_2_001_02:1_2_001_02_b:cmd-000018:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:77fd0056674a0ec4ba581b0d20f03e16ce350ce093bd4abdd2df5d925fca32db",
      "text": "某天开完会后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_02_1_2_001_02:1_2_001_02_b:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3068a17754dd20c02035a7e73594ac440e8e4378f1f3add4afda8ad55154f567",
      "text": "前阵子冬马做给我们吃的咖喱真美味啊。\n用了什么特殊的香料吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_02_1_2_001_02:1_2_001_02_b:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:89f62a37d123c364ae8c20fb705ff47fcf049b3df4b5f927a38cea392fbd4ff5",
      "text": "怎么了，突然问这个？\n香料是我自己调配的独家配方……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_02_1_2_001_02:1_2_001_02_b:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8da1fd8b4122a27ea3050eebae1c79fd7448099d5fd9b47e1e69d26813c4c2f8",
      "text": "……等等，说起来太长了待会儿在LINK上发给你。\n话说，你问这个干嘛？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_02_1_2_001_02:1_2_001_02_b:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4ce10dcffbb92d2325ce0962b45925b6b95854a5cba87b8aacb0727fd77639ce",
      "text": "因为实在太美味了，所以有点好奇嘛。\n我等你的LINK哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_02_1_2_001_02:1_2_001_02_b:cmd-000066:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:835689fab83116009803a3ed0a1af126ad3f8db7566a8a585f5c88412a5c43db",
      "text": "又过了几天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_02_1_2_001_02:1_2_001_02_b:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ed7f45bfc767220f9407cf2341a5b8d94922f6dc239ba66a32fe82373aa1e524",
      "text": "嗯？翔太，你午饭吃咖喱了？\n感觉有香料的味道啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_02_1_2_001_02:1_2_001_02_b:cmd-000096:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7e5a1fd29814eb297df395706f51262185ea2f5fcb4448aed1037d6acb1f6a73",
      "text": "啊～……对呀对呀。突然很想吃嘛！\n不过真不愧是冬马君呢。对咖喱好敏感～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_02_1_2_001_02:1_2_001_02_b:cmd-000107:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3a16f41464a1990b931dd9393be4c79422c240f262a067fbd8604760e3b74fb2",
      "text": "（沾上试做咖喱的味道了吗。\n自己完全闻不出来呢～）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_02_1_2_001_02:1_2_001_02_b:cmd-000123:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:36eee647222f90ee1c2f2922c1946a296f5d3928f6833b1422cab0a0496a5485",
      "text": "哪家咖喱店啊？\n要是在这附近的话，下次我也一起……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_02_1_2_001_02:1_2_001_02_b:cmd-000132:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4f802327a66ef52f4120bdfcc3f214d63048f52b3933db52d2f4f6763d376b8a",
      "text": "啊！我想起来今天回家路上被拜托跑腿了！\n差不多该回去了，回头见冬马君！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_02_1_2_001_02:1_2_001_02_b:cmd-000139:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e7c4d0bdd61b35b05d0bd59ab9abab0e9f8f16567055519fe7837825133b9b3e",
      "text": "哦、哦……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_02_1_2_001_02:1_2_001_02_c:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4f929d3e5d7ab623cb1156811f08750494158828542b73c9c526ee29dd4ec1bd",
      "text": "喂，制作人。\n最近北斗和翔太的样子是不是怪怪的？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_02_1_2_001_02:1_2_001_02_c:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:74d96a1712fbaea59fe0a9e17d8ba7523c99ed35c00dddb01839ea7dccbadf5a",
      "text": "怪怪的，是指？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_02_1_2_001_02:1_2_001_02_c:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6886c44ad33a43296a0883be2c8942ae076ac837c7285542776290cef1f8b860",
      "text": "翔太找我要饭吃的频率减少了不说，\n这阵子身上总有一股咖喱味。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_02_1_2_001_02:1_2_001_02_c:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b60606019b05ab88ee281b2639e58ad42a3658e947d9889ff877f0729209d8f2",
      "text": "北斗也突然开始老是问我\n做咖喱用的香料和材料什么的，难道说……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_02_1_2_001_02:1_2_001_02_c:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d9b7678e74a2245d918fb87196db9b970a93ce478b4faa6afb2adfae8e52950e",
      "text": "他们瞒着我找到了好吃的咖喱店……！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_02_1_2_001_02:1_2_001_02_c:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:111fda629fc8e0d0b17b0d74058f37283f652929112cb4bad90131bbc137e954",
      "text": "（好、好凝重的表情……！\n不过，看来完全没察觉到惊喜呢）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_02_1_2_001_02:1_2_001_02_c:cmd-000105:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f3f7ee6a90a165f5841eee4cbd9baec4eb12287c8286f7fb351d580ed1d10705",
      "text": "还是说他们身边出现了比我还会做咖喱的家伙……？\n喂，你怎么想？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_02_1_2_001_02:1_2_001_02_c:cmd-000110:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:71a8eaa4e898c1f2426fc69975db5e132e6302c87be919bab7026c96588221bf",
      "text": "一定是在体谅忙碌的冬马先生啦。\n他们两个人其实肯定也想吃冬马先生的咖喱的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_02_1_2_001_02:1_2_001_02_c:cmd-000113:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b82c2f9f933399b64879e39c782536fe678b6389662498baf811ee44e6ac05c1",
      "text": "而且，我听说翔太先生的姐姐\n最近也迷上了做咖喱呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_02_1_2_001_02:1_2_001_02_c:cmd-000123:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7d7d1ae1523114e119979bf878462745b4e0dcb15b01320e8090cb57c6aeb3e4",
      "text": "……这样啊，那就好。\n明明根本不需要顾虑我，真是见外啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_02_1_2_001_02:1_2_001_02_d:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a0584f0fe76f839a66fd7db8150d314a24884995d34e1c00c89cda2fa66d04a1",
      "text": "做——好啦。试作第5号！\n比起1号，卖相好看太多了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_02_1_2_001_02:1_2_001_02_d:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:153609265cd5105c3e1b28e764519d1861b714a735c3f718e0b3155882c596d6",
      "text": "打那之后花了不少心思改进呢。\n翔太的手艺也越来越熟练了哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_02_1_2_001_02:1_2_001_02_d:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e379cd2b82107bfba4e22a16e6afe7853d1b430fe4fa232db3898eb37076567b",
      "text": "对吧～。切洋葱不辣眼睛的方法什么的，\n我也渐渐掌握了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_02_1_2_001_02:1_2_001_02_d:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eacc94c74664e3f0123b0383fe90c5583ed1c33a3e50b92e29e3fe13d87a68c6",
      "text": "那么，期待已久的试吃时间到！\n盛给我那份肉要多一点哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_02_1_2_001_02:1_2_001_02_d:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e3fdfd803d7b57c69148231751f09015603583a29e2edab056aac1c18d3c8385",
      "text": "好，请用。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_02_1_2_001_02:1_2_001_02_d:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4639e5156d5f86b057999d6cc57940f00453520cfa586fefac3ebbddce813b05",
      "text": "谢谢！\n那么，我～开动了！嚼嚼……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_02_1_2_001_02:1_2_001_02_d:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:69ca6abc876617e962ab1630dafddf0f48b4663f96a4a31d9aafae2d877aa117",
      "text": "嗯……这个相当不错哦！\n秘密调味料也大获成功呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_02_1_2_001_02:1_2_001_02_d:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cc17eda7b6349ff3bd4e7ef93695c6697ecde6d8889cb6e416704d3875f83c18",
      "text": "……真的呢。\n要是冬马也能喜欢就好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_02_1_2_001_02:1_2_001_02_d:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fbec945a45b89779bac58fc191ee89416da8f790506fe6a1441e833bfee52853",
      "text": "绝对会喜欢的啦！啊，不过秘密调味料要保密哦。\n毕竟这可是只有我们才做得出的特别咖喱嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_02_1_2_001_02:1_2_001_02_d:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ab6d7ce15ecc569d649aa5ee6909094a41d908df8564c01c18e457c85850b39a",
      "text": "好啊，就这么办。\n真期待实际端给他吃的时候。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_02_1_2_001_02:1_2_001_02_e:cmd-000019:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0caba00123987c65267cb553eff1c391af5c1350a25058166325804f0b0c7b21",
      "text": "生日当天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_02_1_2_001_02:1_2_001_02_e:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:083e317a124dd16185c9f3251db0c3dab64b0f8ae7dbda30afea7976b1c7474b",
      "text": "给我发来什么“到事务所的休息室集合！”的LINK……\n翔太那家伙，找我什么事啊？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_02_1_2_001_02:1_2_001_02_e:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a4cbcf77bf3d2704adf582650b94c4ef0523577d937ef7ba94f9d1f2eb9b4e05",
      "text": "（而且……这毫无疑问是咖喱的味道！\n今天一定要搞清楚他们到底在吃什么咖喱）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_02_1_2_001_02:1_2_001_02_e:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:797ad66c883ec5872cd0018e415c02ae1cbba7aee8b0f80711bfcbeb8f528b4f",
      "text": "喂！你们背着我偷……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_02_1_2_001_02:1_2_001_02_e:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ef18afe6770996a8da00445b0d81419c15d56201a2ff2cb4a5977b57e0ad7687",
      "text": "祝你生日快乐，冬马。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_02_1_2_001_02:1_2_001_02_e:cmd-000108:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cae6e7acf8b23701a9cc38b9dd57295df8e1df060fa5a85958b84497ee0ce1c2",
      "text": "……哈？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_02_1_2_001_02:1_2_001_02_e:cmd-000120:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ff071a03b5860ec179ee92ef0def90fd8654bf1f0f01dec96d80bc1fb702a49f",
      "text": "来，今天的主角请坐这边。\n翔太，把咖喱端上来吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_02_1_2_001_02:1_2_001_02_e:cmd-000144:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f51cbd700635079282ec12925d9b1c030bdb8d0ec7444462ef6a4d7ea503cc84",
      "text": "锵——！这是我们为了冬马君亲手做的哦。\n我和北斗君两个人练习了蛮久的呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_02_1_2_001_02:1_2_001_02_e:cmd-000153:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dae00c0b08f6294dfdb4e9ddd042c26bedef6ef174a5dd8acf5dbf03676b1b6b",
      "text": "原、原来是这么回事吗！打听材料什么的，\n还有身上的咖喱味，全都是因为……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_02_1_2_001_02:1_2_001_02_e:cmd-000161:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4baf34f67774c84213f543f5dc2c095a75cda3767408abf700cc2a56d920e272",
      "text": "没错！全都是为了冬马君的生日会哦♪\n快，尝尝看。今天的咖喱可是自信之作呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_02_1_2_001_02:1_2_001_02_e:cmd-000167:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2766022f3293e5299879e301186297c5b0eebcb797d9abf7ffa4fcb783a9f0df",
      "text": "哦，既然如此……\n那我开动了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_02_1_2_001_02:1_2_001_02_e:cmd-000182:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b322984b0494858c7637418736d994a54dcd822a5542a672a71859df207bb76e",
      "text": "嚼嚼……这咖喱，真的超美味啊！\n感觉和我的食谱有些不太一样。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_02_1_2_001_02:1_2_001_02_e:cmd-000190:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:20bda6594add0809d0bb2b83938c22e1731beae4eb8e22e2a66de4795b820c8b",
      "text": "呵呵，因为作为秘密调味料倾注了满满的爱意呢。\n你能喜欢真是太好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_02_1_2_001_02:1_2_001_02_e:cmd-000201:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d65e207af551629043c10466534deabd3fd228c443f19fc87dbde232bbd39a24",
      "text": "可恶，太好吃了停不下来……！\n你们两个也吃啊，难得做出来了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_02_1_2_001_02:1_2_001_02_e:cmd-000214:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:877465b07ab076bfd42e7addcb011dc04e12873e120c6c9306d86b39c1b6afb0",
      "text": "不用你说我也是这么打算的！\n唔～肉和土豆都好大块，真好吃♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_02_1_2_001_02:1_2_001_02_e:cmd-000220:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:720bce2d7178411002d91218ab513433a060861564d4f599a1c29bba76592eac",
      "text": "还有满满的分量可以添饭呢。\n不过，别忘了待会儿还有蛋糕哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_02_1_2_001_02:1_2_001_02_e:cmd-000229:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5664bb77d909426b1ff85ab56ea92f0c26a7e5b2487c43fabb0291175db5a7b5",
      "text": "对了对了，制作人还送了蛋糕让大家一起吃呢。\n等会儿大家一起吃吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_02_1_2_001_02:1_2_001_02_e:cmd-000240:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d383214721ce0e5760e092a8fe9825090c71f9b429f763d1c141c680ea413ac9",
      "text": "这样啊，连制作人都……\n谢谢你们两个，这是最棒的生日了！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
